# Cloud wall lamp · 230.0 × 133.4 × 23.2 mm

Shape: Classic. Keep the parts of this kit together: different
shapes, mirrored outlines and cable exits need their own matching parts.
Surface: Flat.

Print one back, one front and one of each fitting listed below:
- C-cable-seal-TPU-right.stl
- D-cable-clamp-bar-right.stl
- E-cable-clamp-anvil-right.stl
- C-cable-seal-TPU-left.stl
- D-cable-clamp-bar-left.stl
- E-cable-clamp-anvil-left.stl
- C-cable-seal-TPU-top.stl
- D-cable-clamp-bar-top.stl
- E-cable-clamp-anvil-top.stl
